{
  "title": "四棱锥中的平行证明与二面角计算",
  "problem_html": "四棱锥 <span class='t' data-el='v_P'>$P-ABCD$</span> 中，<span class='t' data-el='ln_PA'>$PA \\perp$ 底面 $ABCD$</span>，<span class='t' data-el='ln_PA'>$PA=2$</span>，<span class='t' data-el='ln_AC'>$AC=2$</span>，<span class='t' data-el='ln_BC'>$BC=1$</span>，<span class='t' data-el='ln_AB'>$AB=\\sqrt{3}$</span>。(1) 若 <span class='t' data-el='ln_AD'>$AD \\perp PB$</span>，证明 <span class='t' data-el='ln_AD'>$AD \\parallel$</span> 平面 <span class='t' data-el='pl_PBC'>$PBC$</span>；(2) 若 <span class='t' data-el='ln_AD'>$AD \\perp DC$</span>，且二面角 <span class='t' data-el='pl_ACP'>$A-CP-D$</span> 的正弦值为 <span class='t' data-el='val_sin'>$\\frac{\\sqrt{42}}{7}$</span>，求 <span class='t' data-el='ln_AD'>$AD$</span>。",
  "questions": [
    {
      "label": "(1)",
      "html": "若 <span class='t' data-el='ln_AD'>$AD \\perp PB$</span>，证明 <span class='t' data-el='ln_AD'>$AD \\parallel$</span> 平面 <span class='t' data-el='pl_PBC'>$PBC$</span>。"
    },
    {
      "label": "(2)",
      "html": "若 <span class='t' data-el='ln_AD'>$AD \\perp DC$</span>，且二面角 <span class='t' data-el='pl_ACP'>$A-CP-D$</span> 的正弦值为 <span class='t' data-el='val_sin'>$\\frac{\\sqrt{42}}{7}$</span>，求 <span class='t' data-el='ln_AD'>$AD$</span>。"
    }
  ],
